  "message.googology.guide": "§bGuogaology§r\nRing: twelve blocks in a 5x5 outline without corners; keep the central 3x3 empty.\nOverworld: whole cakes (Guogao blocks may be mixed in) + apple -> Outer.\nOuter -> Inner: 12 mineral storage blocks, freely mixing omega, epsilon, Gamma and Omega; throw in one Omega mineral.\nInner -> Underworld: 12 Guogao blocks of any color, plus one thrown Guogao block.\nReturn: Outer uses dirt/cobblestone; Inner uses Number Stones/Void Glass; Underworld uses Guogao earth/rock. Place 12 and throw in one more permitted local block.\nHorizontal scale Overworld:Outer:Inner:Underworld = 1:1:4:16.\nFalling out of Inner reaches Underworld Y=500; quarter gravity, no fall damage.\nAdmin: /googology visit, inner, guogao, return.",
